alvin: Yeah, Dave! Paying attention to those small details makes a difference. Without them, it's just average. As an artist, I want to create something extraordinary!\n[Image caption: a photo of a silver disc in a black frame on a table]\n[S25T22] (dia_id: D25:22)\n\nDave: That's great, Calvin! Loving the attention to detail in your work, it makes it extra special. Keep on creating!\n[Image caption: a photo of a brown amp with a black knob and a brown cover]\n[S25T23] (dia_id: D25:23)\n\nCalvin: Thanks Dave! Appreciate your support!\n[S25T24] (dia_id: D25:24)\n\nDave: Glad you like it, Cal! It reminds me of the good times I've had at concerts last month. Music has a way of connecting us and making memories. Take a look at this picture, the atmosphere was amazing!\n[Image caption: a photo of a crowd of people at a concert with their hands in the air]\n[S25T25] (dia_id: D25:25)\n\nCalvin: Music has a way of bringing us together and creating unforgettable memories. It's unbeatable in terms of the energy it brings.\n[Image caption: a photo of a crowd of people at a concert with their hands in the air]\n[S25T26] (dia_id: D25:26)\n\nDave: Yeah, for sure Calvin! Concerts are awesome, they bring people together and create such a cool vibe. You can feel the energy in the air. Take a look at this unforgettable moment that I captured at the concert.\n[Image caption: a photo of a crowd of people standing around a stage]\n[S25T27] (dia_id: D25:27)\n\nCalvin: Concerts are what I live for - the indescribable connection between the artist and the crowd is just amazing!\n[S25T28] (dia_id: D25:28)\n\nDave: Wow, it's amazing how that connection between artist and crowd can be indescribable. So glad you get to experience that!\n[S25T29] (dia_id: D25:29)\n\nCalvin: Wow, Dave! It's a rush connecting with everyone. That feeling is unbeatable! Wishing you a harmonious day ahead, my friend!\n[S25T30] (dia_id: D25:30)","text_sha256":"dfb632d32d781d62b89b43ee8db2d5aab76dea473f05b14e21c9490fbd8f902d","timestamp":"2023-10-23T14:17:00"}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","pre_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":506,"filesystem_tool_calls":0,"model_calls":4,"orchestration_calls":4,"prompt_tokens":12125,"provider_request_attempts":4,"provider_rounds":4,"token_usage_available":true,"total_tokens":12631},"model":{"requested_model":"coding","served_models":["qwen3.8:27b"]},"prompt_contract":{"derived_prompt_sha256":"6930d93099ac20b76e881b68cbb63b46e1a0a3e2ff43453db685551c3339a6dc","filesystem_tools_sha256":"98017e74a12c2eec4f0139c484d2d6bd809e4f37a8f96c7f419dc9591563dbfa","orchestration_actions_sha256":"3fa6b1160c2f7f9b2a8b3e232721d4ca78a161abb31af0d4f1f2e307b7354581","paper_prompt_id":"refind-appendix-a-stage1-plus-temporal-normalized-v1","paper_prompt_sha256":"20422063cc471ee1de75c38e4250e1a141a731ea2970786a6c715dc3c83cf7de"},"protocol_version":"shared-evidence-bundle-v1","question":{"conversation_id":"conv-50","question":"Would Calvin enjoy performing at the Hollywood Bowl?","question_id":"conv-50-q014","question_set_id":"locomo-conv50-main40-v1","run_position":22,"schema_version":1},"question_sha256":"d6d87bfeaba86b78c48603debf0b995edd33c552402810f62e1c07440ae4a3b8","runtime_contract":{"evidence_budget_limit":16000,"evidence_budget_unit":"characters","round_limit":4,"runtime_sha256":"cfa70cb3701852c40a6534dabb77c947cd262fb73d4c09e37d72bb7205058366"},"schema_version":1,"search_actions":[{"action":"search_chatrecord","arguments":{"keywords":["Calvin","Hollywood Bowl","performing","concert","music"],"top_k":5},"event":"action","observation_id":"obs-0001","provider_round":1,"query_terms":["calvin","hollywood","bowl","perform","concert","music"],"result_count":5,"returned_sessions":["session_7","session_24","session_25"],"thought":"I need to find evidence about Calvin's preferences an